{"numberOfHits":1,"results":[{"id":"GO:0061822","isObsolete":false,"name":"ciliary cap","definition":{"text":"An intracellular compartmentalized cilium structure found in insect spermatids which is bounded by a membrane derived from the invagination of the cell membrane that remains associated with the primary cilium as it is internalized. The ciliary cap is maintained at the end of the axoneme distal to the centriole and is separated from the cytosolic axoneme/cytoplasm by a putative transition zone, which may extend into the ciliary cap, and include a structure at the base of the ciliary cap termed the ring centriole.","xrefs":[{"dbCode":"PMID","dbId":"25447994"},{"dbCode":"PMID","dbId":"27646273"}]},"synonyms":[{"name":"spermatid ciliary cap","type":"exact"}],"history":[{"timestamp":"2019-09-12","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"part of GO:0005929 (cilium)"},{"timestamp":"2019-09-12","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0110165 (cellular anatomical structure)"},{"timestamp":"2019-09-12","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044441 (obsolete ciliary part)"},{"timestamp":"2017-01-21","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2017-01-19","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044441 (obsolete ciliary part)"},{"timestamp":"2017-01-19","action":"Added","category":"TERM","text":"ciliary cap"},{"timestamp":"2017-01-19","action":"Added","category":"DEFINITION","text":"An intracellular compartmentalized cilium structure found in insect spermatids which is bounded by a membrane derived from the invagination of the cell membrane that remains associated with the primary cilium as it is internalized. The ciliary cap is maintained at the end of the axoneme distal to the centriole and is separated from the cytosolic axoneme/cytoplasm by a putative transition zone, which may extend into the ciliary cap, and include a structure at the base of the ciliary cap termed the ring centriole."},{"timestamp":"2017-01-19","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"spermatid ciliary cap"}],"taxonConstraints":[{"ancestorId":"GO:0061822","ancestorName":"ciliary cap","relationship":"only_in_taxon","taxId":"50557","taxIdType":"NCBITaxon","taxName":"Insecta"}],"aspect":"cellular_component","usage":"Unrestricted","blacklist":[{"goId":"GO:0061822","reason":"1 NOT-qualified manual annotation exists with evidence code ECO:0000314 from this reference: PMID:34553759","category":"NOT-qualified manual","entityType":"protein","entityId":"A1ZB91","taxonId":"7227","entityName":"DAAF3_DROME","ancestorGoId":"GO:0005929"},{"goId":"GO:0061822","reason":"1 NOT-qualified manual annotation exists with evidence code ECO:0000266 from this reference: GO_REF:0000121","category":"NOT-qualified manual","entityType":"protein","entityId":"B1WC73","taxonId":"10116","entityName":"B1WC73_RAT","ancestorGoId":"GO:0005929"},{"goId":"GO:0061822","reason":"1 NOT-qualified manual annotation exists with evidence code ECO:0000266 from this reference: GO_REF:0000121","category":"NOT-qualified manual","entityType":"protein","entityId":"O08697","taxonId":"10116","entityName":"ARL2_RAT","ancestorGoId":"GO:0005929"},{"goId":"GO:0061822","reason":"1 NOT-qualified manual annotation exists with evidence code ECO:0000314 from this reference: PMID:17646400","category":"NOT-qualified manual","entityType":"protein","entityId":"P36404","taxonId":"9606","entityName":"ARL2_HUMAN","ancestorGoId":"GO:0005929"},{"goId":"GO:0061822","reason":"1 NOT-qualified manual annotation exists with evidence code ECO:0000314 from this reference: PMID:17646400","category":"NOT-qualified manual","entityType":"protein","entityId":"P36405","taxonId":"9606","entityName":"ARL3_HUMAN","ancestorGoId":"GO:0005929"},{"goId":"GO:0061822","reason":"1 NOT-qualified manual annotation exists with evidence code ECO:0000266 from this reference: GO_REF:0000121","category":"NOT-qualified manual","entityType":"protein","entityId":"P37996